##🎨 Key Highlights Included in MochiCal

Pastel Theme Engine: Instant theme switching between Sakura Dream, Matcha Garden, Moonlight Lavender, Sunny Morning, and Teddy Cafe.

Digital Journal & Productivity Panel: Built-in Pomodoro focus timer, hydration water counter with visual fill animations, daily habit tracker, and mood logs.

Full Event Creation System: Modal popup complete with emoji picker, category tag selector, priority indicators, and customizable mood logs.

Flexible Calendar Views: Smoothly transition between Month, Week, Day, and Agenda views.

Cozy Aesthetic Touches: Soft rounded surfaces, paper-clip/washi-tape styling, gentle glassmorphism cards, and floating kawaii stickers.
